---
title: "Eclipse"
artist: "Western Artist"
key: "D"
tags: ["english"]
---

[D]All that you touch

[D/C]All that you see

[A#]All that you taste

[A]All you feel

[D]All that you love

[D/C]All that you hate

[A#]All you distrust

[A]All you save

[D]All that you give

[D/C]All that you deal

[A#]All that you buy

beg, [A]borrow or steal

[D]All you create

[D/C]All you destroy

[A#]All that you do

[A]All that you say

[D]All that you eat

[D/C]everyone you meet

[A#]All that you slight

[A]everyone you fight

[D]All that is now

[D/C]All that is gone

[A#]All that's to come

and [A]everything under the [D]sun is in tune

but the [D/C]sun is [A#]eclipsed by the [D]moon.
